async function fetchProtectedBlob(token:string,url:string,fallback:string):Promise<Blob>{const r=await fetch(url,{headers:{'Authorization':`Bearer ${token}`}});if(!r.ok)throw new Error(await errorDetail(r,fallback));return r.blob();}
export async function personnelRegisterPdf(token:string,filters:{q?:string;status?:string;category?:string}={}):Promise<Blob>{const qs=new URLSearchParams();if(filters.q)qs.set('q',filters.q);if(filters.status)qs.set('status',filters.status);if(filters.category)qs.set('category',filters.category);return fetchProtectedBlob(token,`${API}/personnel/exports/register.pdf?${qs}`,'PDF Personnel impossible');}
export async function personnelRegisterXlsx(token:string,filters:{q?:string;status?:string;category?:string}={}):Promise<Blob>{const qs=new URLSearchParams();if(filters.q)qs.set('q',filters.q);if(filters.status)qs.set('status',filters.status);if(filters.category)qs.set('category',filters.category);return fetchProtectedBlob(token,`${API}/personnel/exports/register.xlsx?${qs}`,'Excel Personnel impossible');}
export async function staffProfilePdf(token:string,id:string):Promise<Blob>{return fetchProtectedBlob(token,`${API}/personnel/${id}/profile.pdf`,'Fiche PDF impossible');}
export type PersonnelScopeOptions={sections:{id:string;code:string;label:string}[];classes:{id:string;code:string;label:string;section_id:string;section_code:string;section_label:string}[]};
